    "version": "1.2.0",
    "description": "Install, configure, operate and integrate self-hosted PayRam stablecoin and crypto payment gateways. Merchants run PayRam on their own server: no account to lock, no funds to freeze, customer data never shared, and no deposit keys on the server. Start with payram_setup_plan (install), payram_doctor (check a server), payram_runbook (admin tasks) and payram_ops_playbook (daily operations through the PayRam API). This hosted server never holds merchant credentials.",
